Converting a SQL query to a MongoDB query can be complex due to the differences in their query languages and data models. However, I can provide you with a generic Java code using the MongoDB Java Driver to handle some common cases. This code uses the `com.mongodb.client.MongoCollection` interface and the `org.bson.conversions.Bson` type to build queries.

